{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>בבנות</b> Two times in the Masorah: בבנות הארץ · בבנות אחיך אשר — by Samson. To teach: because he did not wish to give his daughter to his brother, as stated in the Midrash, that he hid her in a box from him, he was punished that she went out to see בבנות הארץ and married Shechem."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:40.850327464Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}